                                "sense_id": "4f1dd9b6-61f7-3c5b-bd06-cd81af7a03e6",
                                "text": "Cohn began the seder with a kiddush for wine, and the first two toasts he proposed were the traditional ones to life and to freedom."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4854cad6-0288-4074-bb0f-1d88bbf4293e",
                                "sense_id": "4f1dd9b6-61f7-3c5b-bd06-cd81af7a03e6",
                                "text": "The world’s richest Jew may have pledged to give the vast majority of his wealth to charity, but Mark Zuckerberg’s great-grandfather’s kiddush cup is staying in the family. […] “For shabbat tonight, we gave Max a kiddush cup that has been in our family for almost 100 years,” the 33-year-old billionaire wrote on his Facebook social media platform."
                            }
